Exploratory Data Analysis

Project Overview

     This project is completed as part of the CodeAlpha
     Data Analytics Internship.The objective is to perform 
     Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) on the dataset collected during Task 1.

Objective

     1.Understand the structure of the dataset.
     2.Check for missing values.
     3.Identify duplicate records.
     4.Clean and prepare the dataset.
     5.Analyze the dataset using statistical methods.
     6.Identify useful patterns and insights.

Technologies Used

     1.Python
     2.Pandas
     3.NumPy
     4.Matplotlib
     5.Google Colab

Dataset
 
     The dataset contains book-related information
     collected through web scraping.
     1.Book Title
     2.Price
     3.Rating
     4.Availability

